          "identification_status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "《梁書》本傳明載父騫，字威明。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-041-liang41:p003",
      "text": "子褒，字子漢，七歲能屬文。",
